CBMC ignores alignas in struct layout (sizeof 1 instead of 4); the
libstdc++ __aligned_membuf pattern under std::map/std::unordered_set
nodes inherits the wrong layout.  Reduced from cpp20_map_basic via
cvise (valgrind-clean 32-line false positive on m[1] == 42).
